cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use this launcher in your work, please cite it using the metadata below. If you use VIDEPE itself, please also cite VIDEPE (see references).'
type: software
title: 'videpe-python-launcher: a reference Python host app for VIDEPE'
abstract: 'A minimal, standard-library-only Python example that shows how to launch VIDEPE (Visualization & Integration of Data for Epilepsy Presurgical Evaluation) in host-app mode as a neural data file viewer from your own Python app.'
